{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "44daac3e-0482-8e69-a8b8-0ae844fb6438",
  "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:50:34-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marco Fiore",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:47:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:47:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, morning. Marco Fiore here. I got a parking ticket stuck under my wiper and I think it's a bum one. I want to know how I go about contesting it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:47:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you have the ticket in front of you? There should be a ticket number up in the top corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:47:40-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got it right here. Hang on, my glasses are on the other table. [pause] Okay. It says expired meter, but I wasn't even at a meter. I was parked on the street in front of my place, 21 Howard Street. Maybe they got confused, I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:47:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be a mislabeled violation, could be something else. Either way you're allowed to contest it. You can do it by mail with a written explanation, or you can ask for a hearing and appear in person."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:48:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So what's a hearing look like? Do I need to bring somebody, or is it just me and a guy behind a desk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:48:17-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the second one, minus the drama. A hearing officer looks at the ticket, you tell your side, and you bring whatever backs you up. Photos of where you were parked, any signs nearby, that sort of thing. They decide then or send it to you after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:48:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Photos. Okay. I can walk out there and take a few, nothing says no meter on my block that I ever saw."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:48:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would help. Take the whole block if you can, so they see the signs or lack of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:48:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Now, another thing. This is the first one I've gotten in years. Can they waive it if it's a first time? Seems fair to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:48:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a fair question. Sometimes the hearing officer has some leeway, but I can't promise it on a phone call. Best thing is to ask for it when you contest, and put it in writing too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:49:09-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. So I ask and they say yes or no. Wonderful. I tell you, I wasn't even in a bad mood this morning. I found a jacket at the thrift store yesterday, fits me perfect, first one in ages that does. Then I walk out and there's this thing on my car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:49:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the jacket's a win. The ticket we'll work on. Is there a deadline printed on it? Usually there's a date by which you have to respond."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:49:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look. [pause] It says twenty-one days from the date. So I got till the end of the month or thereabouts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:49:43-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then you've got time, but don't sit on it. Send in the request for a hearing, with your ticket number, name, and a short note on why you're disputing it. Mail it to the address printed on the ticket."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:49:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Do I call back to schedule the hearing, or do they send me something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:50:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They'll send you a notice with the date and time. If a week or two goes by and nothing shows up, call us back with your ticket number and we'll look it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:50:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Ticket number, name, a note, photos. I can do that. Seems like a lot for a ticket that shouldn't exist, but alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:50:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Welcome to city government. Anything else I can help with, Mr. Fiore?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:50:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks for the help. I'll get it in the mail today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T10:50:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Have a good weekend."
    }
  ],
